      "title": "Used or Reconditioned — Which Mercedes Engine to Buy?",
      "options": [
        {
          "icon": "car",
          "title": "Used Mercedes engines",
          "paragraphs": [
            "Removed from a donor vehicle, inspected and tested before sale, with recorded mileage stated on the listing. The lower-cost route — well suited to high-supply families like the OM646, M271 and K9K where donor availability keeps prices down.",
